{"id":"55a39456f65ebe3f","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-demuth-tt-random-degree.md","title":"Demuth真值表下界中的随机代表","display":"thm-demuth-tt-random-degree — Demuth真值表下界中的随机代表","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-demuth-tt-random-degree","aliases":["43-thm-demuth-tt-random-degree"],"display":"thm-demuth-tt-random-degree — Demuth真值表下界中的随机代表","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-tt]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.10 Theorem 9.10.1，印刷203，PDF223","source_scope":"book-erratum","verification_status":"external-source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_proof_status":"corrected-Turing-degree-statement; original-wtt-claim-refuted","external_source":"Laurent Bienvenu and Christopher Porter, Strong reductions in effective randomness","external_source_url":"https://www.labri.fr/perso/lbienvenu/docs/publications/Randomness_and_strong_reductions_TCS.pdf","external_source_location":"Theorem 5.1 (PDF p.14); Corollary 5.5 (PDF p.16)","external_preprint":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1110.1860v2","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-demuth-tt-random-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-demuth-tt-random-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-demuth-tt-random-degree — Demuth真值表下界中的随机代表"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"57ebf9aa27784e60\" href=\"?note=57ebf9aa27784e60\" title=\"43-df-tt\">43-df-tt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.10 Theorem 9.10.1，印刷203，PDF223"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book-erratum"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"corrected-Turing-degree-statement; original-wtt-claim-refuted"},{"key":"external_source","html":"Laurent Bienvenu and Christopher Porter, Strong reductions in effective randomness"},{"key":"external_source_url","html":"<a href=\"https://www.labri.fr/perso/lbienvenu/docs/publications/Randomness_and_strong_reductions_TCS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.labri.fr/perso/lbienvenu/docs/publications/Randomness_and_strong_reductions_TCS.pdf</a>"},{"key":"external_source_location","html":"Theorem 5.1 (PDF p.14); Corollary 5.5 (PDF p.16)"},{"key":"external_preprint","html":"<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1110.1860v2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1110.1860v2</a>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 按序列的特征集合解释，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"57ebf9aa27784e60\" href=\"?note=57ebf9aa27784e60\" title=\"43-df-tt\">43-df-tt</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}\">\\(\\operatorname{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(A)\\land B\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}A\\land\\neg\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(B)\\Rightarrow\\exists C\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLRandom}(C)\\land B\\equiv_TC\\land B\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}C\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MLRandom}(A)\\land B\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}A\\land\\neg\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(B)\\Rightarrow\\exists C\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLRandom}(C)\\land B\\equiv_TC\\land B\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}C\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>勘误：2007草稿9.10.1写成B与随机点双向wtt等价，这一加强是假的。Bienvenu–Porter的Theorem 5.1给出这里采用的正确版本：Turing等价并保留B≤ttC；Corollary 5.5构造非可计算的随机tt像B，它甚至不能wtt计算任何ML随机点。故本项没有把草稿错误结论留作theorem，也没有只靠限制依赖资格保留假命题。来源及反例陈述已核对，完整来源证明未逐步重验。<a href=\"https://www.labri.fr/perso/lbienvenu/docs/publications/Randomness_and_strong_reductions_TCS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">作者论文</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1110.1860v2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">预印本</a>。</p>\n<p>原证明的测度推送思路保留非原子随机点的Turing度；非原子柱集测度趋零并不提供可计算的统一使用界，不能据此推出反向wtt归约。前提tt也不能无条件换成Turing归约。此处Demuth定理是随机度的历史定理，与Demuth随机性检验节点不同。</p>\n<p>原稿位置：§9.10 Theorem 9.10.1，印刷203，PDF223。正确陈述与wtt反例的核验来源分别为上述作者稿Theorem 5.1、Corollary 5.5；没有将后续勘误伪装成草稿原文。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-tt","status":"resolved","id":"57ebf9aa27784e60","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-tt]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-tt","status":"resolved","id":"57ebf9aa27784e60","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A,B\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}$、$\\equiv_T$ 按序列的特征集合解释，见 [[43-df-tt]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$\\operatorname{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A,B\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}$、$\\equiv_T$ 按序列的特征集合解释，见 [[43-df-tt]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$\\operatorname{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A,B\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}$、$\\equiv_T$ 按序列的特征集合解释，见 [[43-df-tt]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$\\operatorname{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A,B\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}$、$\\equiv_T$ 按序列的特征集合解释，见 [[43-df-tt]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$\\operatorname{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(A)\\land B\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}A\\land\\neg\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(B)\\Rightarrow\\exists C\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLRandom}(C)\\land B\\equiv_TC\\land B\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}C\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2800,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-251","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-demuth-tt-random-degree]] — Demuth真值表下界中的随机代表"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","f357216a7edb035a","57ebf9aa27784e60","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}